# Donor payload, not source.
#
# bin/ and lib64/ are regenerated from the local donor extracts by
# `python3 compat/audio/runtime/assemble_runtime.py` (see manifest.json for the
# per-file origin and SHA-256).  They are extracted from the device image, so
# they must never be committed; the assembler and the two text manifests are
# what the repository keeps.
bin/*
lib64/*
